{"id":"92b2961f9d6bbcaa","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-number-theory.md","title":"Number Theory","display":"df-number-theory — Number Theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-number-theory","aliases":["58-df-number-theory","Number Theory"],"display":"df-number-theory — Number Theory","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-integer.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-number-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-number-theory</span><span>Number Theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-number-theory — Number Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"244943f88396309f\" href=\"?note=244943f88396309f\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-integer.md\">../batch20/58-df-integer.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,m,n\\in V\">\\(a,b,m,n\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Z\">\\(\\mathbb Z\\)</span> (integer set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"244943f88396309f\" href=\"?note=244943f88396309f\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-integer.md\">../batch20/58-df-integer.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Coprime}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Coprime}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (coprimality predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}number\\text{-}theory} \\vdash \\mathrm{Coprime}_S(a,b) \\leftrightarrow a,b\\in\\mathbb Z\\land\\exists m,n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(ma+nb=1)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}number\\text{-}theory} \\vdash \\mathrm{Coprime}_S(a,b) \\leftrightarrow a,b\\in\\mathbb Z\\land\\exists m,n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(ma+nb=1)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Bézout's identity gives a source-free characterization of coprimality inside the integer ring; no undefined <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gcd\">\\(\\gcd\\)</span> function is assumed.</li>\n<li>Number theory: study of integers and their properties; prime numbers central.</li>\n<li>Prime: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p &gt; 1\">\\(p &gt; 1\\)</span> with no nontrivial divisors; fundamental theorem of arithmetic</li>\n<li>GCD, modular congruence, and Euler's theorem are standard number-theoretic constructions or theorems, not all definitions of this atom.</li>\n<li>Analytic NT: uses analysis to study primes; Dirichlet, Riemann, Hardy-Littlewood</li>\n<li>Algebraic NT: studies number fields; class field theory, Iwasawa theory</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hardy and Wright, An Introduction to the Theory of Numbers</li>\n<li>Neukirch, Algebraic Number Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-integer.md","status":"resolved","id":"244943f88396309f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-integer.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-integer.md","status":"resolved","id":"244943f88396309f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb Z$ (integer set, see [[../batch20/58-df-integer.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"a,b,m,n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Coprime}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}number\\text{-}theory} \\vdash \\mathrm{Coprime}_S(a,b) \\leftrightarrow a,b\\in\\mathbb Z\\land\\exists m,n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(ma+nb=1)","display":true},{"tex":"\\gcd","display":false},{"tex":"p > 1","display":false}],"bytes":1358,"backlinks":[{"id":"b5a73a9da7e1ce01","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2a8759d3e1558bf3","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c112e121aec5c9ff","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-896","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-number-theory.md|58-df-number-theory]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["244943f88396309f"]}